    "markdown": "---\nengine: knitr\n---\n\n# Strings\n![](/images/string_bubble.png){style=\"width:200px; background: white; border-radius:5px; border: 5px white solid\" fig-align=\"center\"}\n\n__<u id='string'>Strings</u>__ are used to store alphanumeric text. A __<u id='string'>string</u>__ is defined by enclosing the text with either single quotes (`'text'`) or double quotes (`\"text\"`).\n    \nIn the below code we define two __<u id='string'>string</u> <u id='variable'>variables</u>__, and then retrieve them again by using their name, or identifier.\n\nAs before, for each code block below create a __code cell__, enter the code, and run it.\nDo this for all future code examples.\n    \n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\n#Assign string variables\nDNA_string = \"GCACAAACC\"\namino_acids = \"ARG VAL TRP\"\n#Call the DNA_string variable\nDNA_string\n```\n:::\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.python .cell-code}\n#Call the amino_acids string variable\namino_acids\n```\n:::\n\n\nYou will notice that you can use your __<u id='variable'>variables</u>__ in the same __cell__ you created it in, or in a different __cell__. \nAs long as you have run the code that creates/assigns the __<u id='variable'>variable</u>__ you can use it elsewhere in the same notebook.\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-e10463da2f23d1fc52e6\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-e10463da2f23d1fc52e6\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"function\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Named block of code that performs specific tasks\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-463bfcf10c03a20e9433\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-463bfcf10c03a20e9433\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"operator\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"+, -, *, /, and more\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-1bdea483dfa54cbf1330\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-1bdea483dfa54cbf1330\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"string\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Text, denoted by quotes (\\\"text\\\" or 'text')\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-a1bb9c0776f021c104e4\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-a1bb9c0776f021c104e4\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"integer\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Whole numbers, e.g. 1, 2, 3, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-9b07578ac1868c4f1605\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-9b07578ac1868c4f1605\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"float\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Real numbers (can contain decimal point), e.g. 1, 2.5, 3.14, etc\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-fb2e4f21d0e7722d80d0\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-fb2e4f21d0e7722d80d0\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"boolean\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"True or False\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-51c2e46d961e5d60aefb\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-51c2e46d961e5d60aefb\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"variable\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Container of information with a name\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<span class=\"tippy html-widget html-fill-item\" height=\"464px\" id=\"htmlwidget-14c119f8f3cde0bcc68e\" width=\"100%\"></span>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-14c119f8f3cde0bcc68e\">{\"x\":{\"element\":\"class\",\"opts\":{\"content\":\"Type of data, e.g. string, integer, float, boolean, etc.\",\"arrow\":true,\"placement\":\"bottom\"}},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n",
